or","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, October to November has come in under 90% of normal in 36 of the 75 years since 1951 on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 42% of normal in October to November and 32% in November to December. So far in 2026, March to April came in at 23% of normal on the middle of the grids. Grid 18800 had its driest year in 1986 at 65% of normal.</p>"}
